title: Payers › Workflow Builder › Configure a step › Actions
route: /payers/summit?tab=builder
intro: Action steps do something: make a task, notify, draft a document, prepare a portal, fax or phone submission, ask for approval, set a status, schedule a follow-up, escalate, create an appeal, or update Case Manager. Preparing a submission is kept apart from sending it, and anything that reaches the payer needs a person's approval first.
dir: TD
---
start s1 "Select an action step"
decision d1 "Which kind of action?"
screen a1 "Create task: 'Task', 'For', 'Due in'\nSend notification: 'Tell', 'Message'\nGenerate document: 'Document' (cover sheet, notice of admission, letter of medical necessity, appeal letter)"
screen a2 "Request human approval: 'Who approves', 'What they approve'\nA clinician, an authorization coordinator or a manager\nThe real sign-off gate in New Case: only a clinician signs, nothing is sent until they do"
screen a3 "Update authorization status: 'Status' (Draft, Ready for review, Submitted, Acknowledged,\nUnder review, Info requested, Approved, Denied, Completed)\nSchedule follow-up: 'After', 'Counted in', 'How'"
screen a4 "Escalate case: 'Escalate to', 'Reason'\nUpdate Case Manager: 'History line' and 'Book the next review'\n(writes a real line to the case's history)"
screen ph "Prepare phone call: 'What Caller says' (the script)\nand 'Place the call once approved'"
screen pp "Prepare portal submission or Prepare fax packet:\n'Send it once approved' (off: the packet is prepared and a person sends it),\n'Notes for the person who submits', 'Add a cover sheet'\nCreate appeal: 'Kind' (reconsideration, peer-to-peer call, written appeal)"
process p1 "Steps that reach the payer are marked with 'A person approves first', always on\n'Steps that reach the payer always need a person's approval.'"
process p2 "Support shown on the step: Demo simulation for all but the sign-off gate and Update Case Manager\nNothing leaves the app"
click c1 "Edit the script or any field"
process p3 "Held in the builder until 'Save draft'"
end e1 "The action is set up, and prepare is separate from send"

s1 --> d1
d1 -->|Task, notify, document| a1 --> p2
d1 -->|Approval| a2 --> p2
d1 -->|Status, follow-up| a3 --> p2
d1 -->|Escalate, Case Manager| a4 --> p2
d1 -->|Phone| ph --> p1
d1 -->|Portal, fax, appeal| pp --> p1
p1 --> p2 --> c1 --> p3 --> e1
